{"id":"vod_bf_27325","vodId":"27325","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"青之驱魔师","name_cn":"青之驱魔师","date":"2011-01-01","year":"2011","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.bfzypic.com/upload/vod/20230424-28/9a002ffd8cb03e9f4c986406e8bc41e4.jpg"},"summary":"奥村磷（冈本信彦 配音）自幼被神父藤本狮郎（藤原启治 配音）收养，某一日，磷发现了自己其实是撒旦之子的秘密，之后养父的惨死让磷下定居心走上了驱魔师的道路。磷所存在的世界被分为“物质界”和“虚无界”两大空间，人类生存于物质界，在虚无界中，则徘徊着凶残暴戾的魔鬼。　　身边接连发生的伤害事件让磷逐渐发现，某些虚无界的恶魔，趁虚而入潜入了人类世界。为了伸张正义保护同类，磷果断的担负起了驱魔的职责。在弟弟奥村雪男（福山润 配音）的帮助下，磷不断的向着真相前进，此时的磷也发现，造成这一切混乱的元凶，可能就藏在他们的身边。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2025-04-02 18:00:11","playable":true,"episodeCount":25,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/20241017Mvr5f2i6index.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/202410188ybNfv6zindex.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/qingzhiqumoshi/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/20241017y6lJjxvfindex.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/20241017LBklb6s3index.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/20241017t3oEja50index.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf4.com/video/qingzhiqumoshi/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/20241017pd7Ufar4index.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/20241017ZibokVH1index.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/20241017PKlmG6iXindex.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/202410176nhdC9BGindex.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf4.com/video/